# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tenant evidence. Never commit a real export, not even to a private repo.
# These exports contain UPNs, admin status, registered auth methods, and
# identity-security posture. Treat them like a pen test report.
#
# reports/<tenant>/ is where a default run (no -OutputPath) writes: one folder
# per tenant, named from -CustomerName or the sign-in domain. Ignored wholesale
# so a customer's evidence is never committable no matter what it is called.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
EntraSmsVoiceMigrationImpact_*.csv
*.tenant.csv
/reports/
/output/
/exports/

# Allow the fictional sample only
!examples/Example-MigrationImpact.csv

# Secrets and credentials
*.pfx
*.cer
*.key
*.pem
*.credential
*.clixml
secrets.json
appsettings.*.json
.env
.env.*

# PowerShell
*.ps1xml.bak
PSScriptAnalyzerSettings.user.psd1
/Output/
/BuildOutput/
/TestResults/
testResults*.xml
coverage*.xml
*.pester.xml

# Module staging
/Modules/
/.pester/

# Editors and OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Logs and transcripts
*.log
Transcript_*.txt

# Real tenant lists. Only the sample is tracked.
tenants.csv
tenants.*.csv
!examples/tenants.sample.csv
SweepSummary_*.csv
EntraSmsVoiceMigrationImpact_*.html
*_RemediationGroup.csv
*_ActionList.csv
*_TicketHistory.json
TicketHistory.json
!examples/Example-ActionList.csv
!examples/Example-Report.html
*_Tickets.csv
!examples/Example-Tickets.csv

# -ExportFixScript writes a remediation script naming real users, and
# Compare-EntraSmsVoiceAssessment writes its diff beside the exports it compared.
# Both land wherever -OutputPath points, which is not always under reports/.
*_Remediation.ps1
EntraSmsVoiceChange_*.csv
